	(text "COIL DRIVERS  low-side IRLZ44N, flyback on the terminal, gate clamped.\nOPEN coils take the inhibited 24 V rail. CLOSE coils take the fused rail that stays up.\nA close channel's force diode is armed only when its jumper shunt is fitted."
